{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24787","headline":"七老会诗 · 吉皎","name":"七老会诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休官罢任已闲居，林苑园亭兴有余。\n对酒最宜花藻发，邀欢不厌柳条初。\n低腰醉舞垂绯袖，击筑讴歌任褐裾。\n宁用管弦来合杂，自亲松竹且清虚。\n飞觥酒到须先酌，赋咏成诗不住书。\n借问商山贤四皓，不如此後更何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吉皎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}